    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d432">

                <pb facs="0551" n="443" sameAs="frus:frus1893/pg443"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Foster to Señor
                            Cayetano Romero.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1893-02-10"><hi rendition="#italic">February 10,
                        1893</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to state that the contents
                    of your note of 6th instant, in which you make known the views of your
                    Government on the subject of more effectively pursuing the armed disturbers of
                    the peace on the border through greater concert of action by the troops of both
                    governments, have been communicated to the Secretary of War.</p>
                <p>Accept, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">John W. Foster.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
